1. CYPRESS ASYNC EXECUTION
--------------------------------------------------
let text = 'old';

cy.get('.title').then(($el) => {
  text = $el.text();
});

expect(text).to.not.equal('old');

Question:
Will this pass or fail?

Answer:
FAIL

Reason:
Cypress commands are queued. expect() runs before .then() executes.


